#: ../../../platforms/linux_i686.rst:22
msgid ""
"Linux i686 (32-bit) is a Unix-like and mostly POSIX-compliant computer "
"operating system (OS) assembled under the model of free and open-source "
"software development and distribution. Using host OS (Mac OS X or Linux 32-"
"bit) you can build native application for Linux i686 platform."
msgstr ""

